12
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:39,480
a teamwork and chemistry challenge.

13
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:40,480
Come on, everyone.

14
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:41,880
Let's go over the rules.

15
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:45,080
Within 100 seconds,
you eight people must

16
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:48,960
(Starting point)
go around the Earth Figure from the line

17
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:50,280
(Earth Figure)
and then return to this line

18
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:51,920
