19
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:55,040
(Who are the Balloon Spirits?)
You all pass if the transport is done.

20
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:57,000
But among the eight of you,

21
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,360
