24
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:05,880
The Balloon Spirits don't know
each other's role.

25
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:07,080
It's a best of five rounds.

26
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:09,520
If the Good Persons complete
three balloon transports

27
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:11,360
or successfully identify
the Balloon Spirits,

28
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:12,520
the Good Persons win.

29
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:15,360
Otherwise, the Balloon Spirits win.

30
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:18,080
Next, let's play a trial round.

31
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:29,080
Everyone, please close your eyes.

32
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:32,800
Number one, please open your eyes.

33
00:01:37,242 --> 00:01:38,440
