34
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:39,080
Yang Chaoyue.

35
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:40,920
Nonsense.

36
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,400
(Forcing calmness)
Okay, close your eyes.

37
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:45,040
Number two, please open your eyes.

38
00:01:45,667 --> 00:01:47,591
(Balloon Spirit: Chen Xingxu)

39
00:01:47,591 --> 00:01:48,640
- Yang Chaoyue.
- Li Naiwen.

40
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,280
What the heck?

41
00:01:50,861 --> 00:01:52,710
(Stealth mode)

42
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:54,360
Everyone, please open your eyes.

43
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:05,280
