are the Balloon Spirits, right?

44
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:05,680
Yes.

45
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:07,480
Honglei, you are definitely not one.

46
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,680
You seem very disappointed.

47
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:15,600
Everyone, move behind the white line.

48
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:17,800
