51
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:25,880
It won't grow that fast.

52
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:27,000
Then he's a Beard Spirit.

53
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:27,840
Not a Balloon Spirit.

54
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:29,000
He's a bamboo shoot.

55
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:31,400
Okay, let's line up.

56
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:32,600
It's best to face each other.

57
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:33,440
So everyone can watch.

58
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:33,760
Right?

59
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:35,040
(Proposing face-to-face transport)
- Yes. - Fewer sneaky moves this way.

60
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:35,899
Then let's face each other.

61
00:02:35,899 --> 00:02:37,640
(What should I do?)
First, form a closed loop. Come on.

62
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:39,480
Those two Balloon Spirits
must be scared.

63
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:40,640
Scared to death.

64
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:41,120
They will lose.

65
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:41,760
Not necessarily.

66
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:42,560
Actually, it's simple.

67
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:44,000
I'm a bit suspicious of you.

68
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:46,960
Oh no, you've figured me out.

69
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,840
Yuning, you rarely make such mistakes.

70
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:53,760
Come on. A 100-second countdown

71
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:55,040
