72
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:55,520
Let's go.

73
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:56,400
Let's go.

74
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:56,920
Slow down.

75
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:57,760
Don't rush.

76
00:02:58,880 --> 00:02:59,960
