77
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:02,520
- Squeeze tight.
- Don't be suspected by everyone.

78
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,720
Why are you walking with a T-step?

79
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:04,280
What are you doing?

80
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,760
He's trying to trip people.

81
00:03:05,973 --> 00:03:07,234
(I'm innocent)

82
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,200
Squeeze tight.

83
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,160
Someone keep an eye out.

84
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:11,520
Don't bump into that Earth.

85
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:14,160
Now,

86
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:15,680
