91
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:22,000
We're almost at the Earth Figure.

92
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:24,320
Whoever drops theirs gets blamed.

93
00:03:29,160 --> 00:03:30,600
- Okay.
- Be careful.

94
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:31,760
