Walk faster.

114
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:06,160
We win.

115
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:06,920
Come on.

116
00:04:06,920 --> 00:04:07,280
We win.

117
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:10,000
