144
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:05,120
I'm very sincere. I really am not.

145
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,040
You can look into my eyes.

146
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,960
Come on, same as before.

147
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:14,160
Same as before.

148
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:14,720
Same as before.

149
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:15,452
Be careful.

150
00:05:15,452 --> 00:05:16,120
Be careful.

151
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,440
Be careful.

152
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,280
I'm telling you,

153
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:20,720
being face-to-face

154
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:21,800
