159
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,880
Or they'll trip themselves.

160
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:30,520
That's the only result.

161
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:32,680
Because when everyone moves,
it's basically...

162
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,840
You're already practicing, right?

163
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:34,840
No.

164
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,560
