and she was like this.

165
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,400
Yes, that'll do.

166
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,280
Two will drop at once.

167
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:41,800
Just do that.

168
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:44,760
Come on.

169
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:46,840
Let's go.

170
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:48,400
