- That makes sense.

209
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:48,754
(Took it to heart)

210
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:50,080
Your ear was like this?

211
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:50,600
Yes.

212
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,360
Jingfei's drop

213
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,560
