223
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:16,400
His understanding of me
is limited to the past.

224
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:17,920
We're not that familiar now.

225
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:21,040
That makes sense.

226
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:21,680
- Yes.
- Makes sense.

227
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:23,400
Can't people grow?

228
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:24,720
I was very quiet yesterday.

229
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:25,840
I'm also very quiet today.

230
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:26,680
People do grow.

231
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:27,640
We accept that.

232
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,345
I don't think Kai is.

233
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:31,240
Xingxu,

234
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,320
(Sudden intuition)
is it you?

235
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,400
Is it you or not?

236
00:07:37,436 --> 00:07:38,360
(Is he my teammate?)

237
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:38,960
Then it's him.

238
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:39,760
Then it's him.

239
00:07:40,930 --> 00:07:42,598
(So sudden?)

240
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:44,480
I think he has some other

241
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,280
